                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Tiu-U é‡£é­š is a domino card game that involves tiles, matching, scoring. The game originated in China and has become popular worldwide.',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Country/Region of Origin: China\nTime Period: Early 1900s\nHistorical Development: The game evolved from traditional card games in the region\nCultural Significance: Popular social and family game',
